## Purpose

<A short paragraph. What goes wrong without this contract, and what is true
because of it. No history, no status, no plan — just the reason this promise
exists. Three or four sentences.>

## Core (the teeth)

<Numbered clauses, each one a rule someone could break. Lead with the rule as a
