these numbers, so renumbering breaks the check.>

1. **<The rule, stated as a fact.>** <One to three plain lines: why this is the
   rule, or what it means for the person reading.>
2. **<The next rule.>** <Why.>
3. **<The next rule.>** <Why.>

## What v1 deliberately does NOT freeze

